      "description": "works now; each image waits for a session with it.",
      "label": "Keep registering CI images by hand with your login"
     }
    ],
    "question": "Problems on CI-built images cannot be marked Ready for Customer: Taiga needs a source record per image, and CI (taiga-ci@theorem-agent-infra) has no Taiga login. Your 10-20 ask (dispatch://INFRA-23/ask/f3d40c79) ended with Archana offering taiga-buildbox@autoformalization, and you said \"Ok I will use that\"; nothing was granted. No account here can sign in as it (403), and your admin role there expired 10-23. Archana, Jason or Rajashree can run:\ngcloud iam service-accounts add-iam-policy-binding taiga-buildbox@autoformalization.iam.gserviceaccount.com --project=autoformalization --member=serviceAccount:taiga-ci@theorem-agent-infra.iam.gserviceaccount.com --role=roles/iam.serviceAccountOpenIdTokenCreator\nRecommend option 1. Meanwhile I register CI images by hand.\n",
    "referenced_by_count": 1,
    "state": "open",
    "urgency": "med"
   }
