    "id": "ff473ecd-f8aa-445e-86c0-a9bfb15dd627",
    "body": "No, not any more. I checked as your own account, sami@theorem.dev, at 00:33Z. Your roles on the autoformalization project that could grant this, iam.serviceAccountAdmin and iam.roleAdmin, were time-limited grants titled \"bet40-apply\", and both ended at 2026-10-23 14:31:54Z. Reading taiga-buildbox's own policy is now denied to you too (iam.serviceAccounts.getIamPolicy). Your untimed roles there are compute network and security admin, OS policy admin and service-usage consumer, and none of them covers service-account bindings. So the grant needs Archana, Jason or Rajashree, or a renewed time-limited serviceAccountAdmin for you. If they renew it for you, I can run the one command myself as you, and nothing else.\n",
